  "exit_management": {
    "enabled": true,
    "breakeven_trigger_r": 1.0,
    "trail_trigger_r": 2.0,
    "trail_distance_r": 1.0,
    "losing_time_stop_fraction": 0.35,
    "time_decay_tighten": 0.0,
    "rationale": "Ratchet never loosens the stop, so worst-case risk per trade is unchanged. Breakeven at 1.0R banks winners (roi_lab 10-seed ensemble: +15.9pp ROI, -20.6R maxDD vs legacy). Losing_time_stop_fraction=0.35 exits a still-losing trade after 35% of the holding window, so losers do not consume the full window: ensemble +22.6pp ROI and -62.5R maxDD over breakeven-only. Trail trigger at 2.0R (default target) keeps the trail latent; lower it to catch give-backs when reversal frequency is high. time_decay_tighten (0..1) tightens the stop toward entry near the deadline; kept at 0.0 because it trades ROI for extra drawdown reduction."
  },
